f prayer or puja. Puja or Poojan is a prayer ritual performed by Hindu to host, honour and worship one or more deities, or to spiritually celebrate an event.\n\nWhen I visited Pashupatin Temple, I saw that prayer. And I am bery lucky to see that kind of prayer. \n\nThis temple is Hindu temple which has many stupas and in the evening, you will see this kind of prayer, during the sunset untill end.\n\nPashupati has a holy river besides and there are many monkey too.", "review_tip": null, "rating": 4, "subratings": [], "like_count": 1, "language": "en", "is_translated": false, "original_language": "en", "owner_response": null, "trip": {"trip_type": "friends", "stay_date": "2017-08-31"}, "reviewer": {"reviewer_id": "D3112371F92017EE4B77849356AE1283", "name": "Sultoni D", "profile_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/Profile/909sultonid", "username": "909sultonid", "avatar": "https://dynamic-media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-o/10/00/aa/10/sultonidawand.jpg", "contribution_count": 79, "hometown": {"tripadvisor_entity_id": 790290, "location_name": "Purwokerto", "location_name_detailed": "Purwokerto, Indonesia"}, "is_verified": false}, "images": [], "created_at_date": "2017-08-02", "published_at_date": "2017-08-03"}, {"review_id": 508047108, "review_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/ShowUserReviews-g293890-d310712-r508047108-Pashupatinath_Temple-Kathmandu_Kathmandu_Valley_Bagmati_Zone_Central_Region.html", "title": "Religious experience", "text": "The temple is ancient and needs a guide to explain the story behind it.\nOffers great views of the bagmati river.\nNot a place fir the faint hearted as rituals if the dead being carried out continuously.\nCellphones can be carried but must not be used.\nThe 4 doors of the temple ooen in the evening during sunset and the deity can be viewed from all 4 sides.\n", "review_tip": null, "rating": 4, "subratings": [], "like_count": 0, "language": "en", "is_translated": false, "original_language": "en", "owner_response": null, "trip"